@ Index:  Straight port of the HP-42S triangle solver
@ Author: Hewlett-Packard, Bruce Young, Didier Lachieze, Barry Mead
@ Source: https://forum.swissmicros.com/viewtopic.php?p=38646#p38646
@ Tested: SSS
@ Input:  Sides 3, 4, 5
@ Output: Area 6
@
@ This is the triangle program starting on p.58 of _HP-42S Programming
@ Examples & Techniques_, ported to the R47 by those listed above.
LBL ‘TRI∡’
  ‘SSS’
  KEY 01 XEQ A
  ‘SSA’
  KEY 02 XEQ B
  ‘ASA’
  KEY 03 XEQ C
  ‘SAA’
  KEY 04 XEQ D
  ‘SAS’
  KEY 05 XEQ 40
  MENU
  STOP
  XEQ 41
  GTO ‘TRI∡’

# SSS subroutine
LBL A
  INPUT ‘s1’
  INPUT ‘s2’
  INPUT ‘s3’
  RCL ‘s1’
  RCL+ ‘s2’
  RCL+ ‘s3’
  2
  ÷
  STO ‘perim’
  𝑥²
  LAST𝑥
  RCL× ‘s2’
  -
  RCL ‘s1’
  RCL× ‘s3’
  ÷
  √𝑥
  cos⁻¹(𝑥)
  2
  ×
  STO ‘a3’
  sin(𝑥)
  RCL ‘s1’
  ×
  STO R00
  RCL ‘perim’
  𝑥²
  LAST𝑥
  RCL× ‘s1’
  -
  RCL÷ ‘s2’
  RCL÷ ‘s3’
  √𝑥
  cos⁻¹(𝑥)
  2
  ×
  STO ‘a2’
  RCL+ ‘a3’
  cos(𝑥)
  CHS
  cos⁻¹(𝑥)
  STO ‘a1’
  RTN

# SSA subroutine
LBL B
  INPUT ‘s1’
  INPUT ‘s2’
  INPUT ‘a2’
  sin(𝑥)
  RCL× ‘s2’
  RCL÷ ‘s1’
  sin⁻¹(𝑥)
  STO ‘a3’
  sin(𝑥)
  RCL× ‘s1’
  STO R00
  XEQ 42
  RCL ‘s2’
  𝑥≤? ‘s1’
    RTN
  XEQ 41
  STOP
  RCL ‘a3’
  cos(𝑥)
  CHS
  cos⁻¹(𝑥)
  STO ‘a3’
  XEQ 42
  RTN

# Calculate both SSA cases
LBL 42
  RCL ‘a3’
  RCL+ ‘a2’
  cos(𝑥)
  CHS
  cos⁻¹(𝑥)
  STO ‘a1’
  RCL ‘a2’
  cos(𝑥)
  RCL× ‘s2’
  RCL ‘a3’
  cos(𝑥)
  RCL× ‘s1’
  +
  STO ‘s3’
  RTN

# ASA subroutine
LBL C
  INPUT ‘a3’
  INPUT ‘s1’
  INPUT ‘a1’
  RCL ‘a3’
  RCL+ ‘a1’
  cos(𝑥)
  CHS
  cos⁻¹(𝑥)
  STO ‘a2’
  RCL ‘a3’
  RCL ‘s1’
  →RECT_(HP)
  𝑥⇄𝑦
  STO R00
  RCL ‘a2’
  1
  →RECT_(HP)
  R↓
  ÷
  STO ‘s2’
  R↑
  ×
  +
  STO ‘s3’
  RTN

# SAA subroutine
LBL D
  INPUT ‘s1’
  INPUT ‘a1’
  INPUT ‘a2’
  RCL ‘a1’
  +
  cos(𝑥)
  CHS
  cos⁻¹(𝑥)
  STO ‘a3’
  RCL ‘s1’
  →RECT_(HP)
  𝑥⇄𝑦
  STO R00
  RCL ‘a2’
  1
  →RECT_(HP)
  R↓
  ÷
  STO ‘s2’
  R↑
  ×
  +
  STO ‘s3’
  RTN

# SAS subroutine
LBL 40
  INPUT ‘s1’
  INPUT ‘a1’
  INPUT ‘s2’
  RCL ‘a1’
  𝑥⇄𝑦
  →RECT_(HP)
  RCL- ‘s1’
  →POL_(HP)
  STO ‘s3’
  RCL+ ‘s1’
  RCL+ ‘s2’
  2
  ÷
  STO ‘perim’
  𝑥²
  LAST𝑥
  RCL× ‘s2’
  -
  RCL ‘s1’
  RCL× ‘s3’
  ÷
  √𝑥
  cos⁻¹(𝑥)
  2
  ×
  STO ‘a3’
  sin(𝑥)
  RCL× ‘s1’
  STO R00
  RCL ‘perim’
  𝑥²
  LAST𝑥
  RCL× ‘s1’
  -
  RCL÷ ‘s2’
  RCL÷ ‘s3’
  √𝑥
  cos⁻¹(𝑥)
  2
  ×
  STO ‘a2’
  RTN

# Calculate results
LBL 41
  STOCFG K
  RCL R00
  RCL× ‘s3’
  2
  ÷
  STO ‘area’
  RCL ‘s1’
  RCL+ ‘s2’
  RCL+ ‘s3’
  STO ‘perim’
  FIX 03
  ‘per : ’
  RCL+ ‘perim’
  ‘   area : ’
  RCL+ ‘area’
  +
  ‘s3 : ’
  RCL+ ‘s3’
  ‘   a3 : ’
  RCL+ ‘a3’
  +
  ‘s2 : ’
  RCL+ ‘s2’
  ‘   a2 : ’
  RCL+ ‘a2’
  +
  ‘s1 : ’
  RCL+ ‘s1’
  ‘   a1 : ’
  RCL+ ‘a1’
  +
  RCLCFG K
  END
.END.
